OL,4,B'All coming together' - Isak repaying  
OL,5,BLiverpool faith                        
OL,6,GLiverpool fans have needed to be       
OL,7,Gpatient to see the best of Alexander   
OL,8,GIsak after an injury-hit start to his  
OL,9,Gcareer, but the striker is now proving 
OL,10,Gthe wait has been worth it.            
OL,12,FBy scoring twice against Club Brugge   
OL,13,Fin the Champions League, Isak took his 
OL,14,Ftally for the season to 10 - more than 
OL,15,Fdouble his total for his first season  
OL,16,Fat the Reds.                           
